# Normalise text files to LF in the working tree and the repository (matches .prettierrc endOfLine: lf).
# Git detects binaries automatically; the explicit entries below are belt-and-braces.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.mp3 binary
*.mp4 binary
*.pdf binary
